==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.67~6.67 seconds<sup>20f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.67~6.67 seconds<sup>20f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~6.67 seconds<sup>20f~200f</sup>.
*20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that most units can beat. Bring all of your [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*This is the only stage in which [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] appears with 100% magnification.

